    "description": "The icons of the Android app, which `vfxtool android-icons` writes as the vector drawables android/app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_NAME.xml (NAME in snake case) from the package of \"source\": the outlined symbol, and for the names of \"filled\" the filled one as ic_NAME_fill.xml. \"mirrored\" names turn around in a right-to-left language. A name that \"icons\" has too means the same symbol.",
